WEBVTT

01:31.091 --> 01:33.952
[Episode 9]

01:49.120 --> 01:50.931
[Tomb of Zhang]

01:52.239 --> 01:53.280
Over here.

02:07.840 --> 02:10.879
Sir, look! We just dug this up.

02:13.759 --> 02:15.319
How dare you!

02:15.319 --> 02:17.439
What are you doing?

02:17.439 --> 02:19.919
What are you doing?

02:19.919 --> 02:21.400
Are you even human?

02:22.039 --> 02:24.240
This is utterly inhuman!

02:24.919 --> 02:26.159
Give me back my mother!

02:33.159 --> 02:34.528
Murder!

02:35.319 --> 02:38.280
You're completely lawless!

02:39.560 --> 02:41.280
His family's grave was also dug up.

02:41.280 --> 02:45.280
Master Lv Da, this is a gift for you.

02:46.159 --> 02:50.680
But please, return my mother's body to me.

02:50.680 --> 02:53.520
Let her rest in peace, please.

03:03.960 --> 03:05.639
This is just the ransom.

03:06.240 --> 03:07.719
The ransom?

03:07.719 --> 03:11.960
This hill and its land belong to us now.

03:13.840 --> 03:17.520
None of you are allowed
to bury your family members here

03:18.800 --> 03:22.560
unless you pay us for the burial annually.

03:22.560 --> 03:26.624
I'll have my men find a nice place
to bury your mother. How about that?

03:27.296 --> 03:28.360
Mother!

03:28.360 --> 03:29.800
How can this be allowed?

03:29.800 --> 03:33.560
For generations, this hill has
been the burial ground for our loved ones.

03:33.560 --> 03:35.360
Since when did it become yours?

03:35.360 --> 03:37.439
- Exactly!
- That's right!

03:37.439 --> 03:39.280
Since when did it become your property?

03:39.280 --> 03:40.319
What are you doing?

03:40.319 --> 03:41.639
Let go of me!

03:41.639 --> 03:44.439
Aren't you afraid of retribution?

03:44.439 --> 03:46.120
- Heavens!
- Let go of me!

03:50.520 --> 03:54.479
Retribution?
The dead can't exact retribution.

03:54.479 --> 03:55.680
What do we do?

03:55.680 --> 03:58.080
What can we do? There's nothing we can do.

03:58.080 --> 04:01.240
Hurry back and gather the money!

04:01.240 --> 04:04.080
Go gather the money.

04:04.080 --> 04:08.400
Mr. Jia, he wanted his father's body back.

04:08.400 --> 04:11.360
Look, I've reunited him with his father.

04:11.360 --> 04:13.039
Yes, sure.

04:13.039 --> 04:14.560
Sure.

04:14.560 --> 04:16.920
And you? What's your decision?

04:16.920 --> 04:21.040
Either you take your mother's body back home,
or--

04:21.040 --> 04:24.720
I'll buy it back.

04:26.199 --> 04:29.519
I'll buy it back.

04:33.879 --> 04:36.920
Hand over the money!
Do not let Mr. Lv say it twice!

04:38.759 --> 04:40.920
Come here. Who told you to come?

04:40.920 --> 04:43.519
Brother,
the gang leader didn't give me any jobs.

04:43.519 --> 04:44.680
I have too much time on my hands.

04:45.399 --> 04:47.480
You're collecting burial fees, right?
I can do it too.

04:49.040 --> 04:51.000
Don't you know
why you're not allowed to work?

04:53.240 --> 04:55.480
Don't you know what a huge mistake you made?

04:56.480 --> 05:00.439
If the gang leader didn't have connections,
our gang would have been exposed.

05:00.439 --> 05:02.720
Brother, can't I follow you?

05:03.399 --> 05:05.040
Get lost, now!

05:05.040 --> 05:06.399
- Please!
- Get lost!

05:19.399 --> 05:21.079
Keep digging!

05:21.079 --> 05:22.272
Got it.

05:27.279 --> 05:28.639
<i>After ten years of arduous study,</i>

05:30.120 --> 05:34.592
<i>today, I'll finally stand
before the emperor as his subject.</i>

05:37.959 --> 05:40.240
Miss Meng, the robe looks good on you.

05:40.240 --> 05:42.959
But when you enter the hall,
don't get weak in the knees.

05:44.319 --> 05:48.759
Mr. Shen, did it happen to you
on your first day at court?

05:48.759 --> 05:49.800
Of course not.

05:50.800 --> 05:55.240
Then can you tell me
what His Majesty is like at court?

05:57.240 --> 05:59.160
Have you heard a saying?

06:00.399 --> 06:02.000
Being with the sovereign is
like being with a tiger.

06:02.000 --> 06:03.072
I've heard it.

06:06.800 --> 06:10.079
When His Majesty gets angry,
everyone gets scared.

06:10.680 --> 06:11.720
Last month,

06:11.720 --> 06:15.560
a colleague was dismissed
for saying one extra word in his report.

06:15.560 --> 06:16.680
And another colleague

06:16.680 --> 06:19.279
angered His Majesty and was directly...

06:23.839 --> 06:25.000
But don't worry.

06:25.000 --> 06:27.920
For Zhi Li's sake, I won't stand idly by.

06:27.920 --> 06:30.319
If anyone targets you, I will--

06:33.120 --> 06:34.959
Miss Meng, I haven't finished yet!

06:34.959 --> 06:37.319
His Majesty has arrived.

06:47.800 --> 06:52.240
Your Majesty. May Your Majesty be blessed!

06:52.240 --> 06:53.720
Everyone, rise.

07:00.212 --> 07:01.984
[Shen Mansion]

07:07.560 --> 07:08.608
Thank you.

07:11.480 --> 07:14.959
Zhi Li, the weather is chilly.
Be careful not to catch a cold.

07:16.839 --> 07:19.759
What's bothering my brilliant sister?

07:20.680 --> 07:24.319
I must say a drink can solve anything.

07:37.240 --> 07:39.160
It seems something is truly troubling you.

07:39.160 --> 07:43.008
His Majesty has transferred me
to the Censorate as an Assistant Director

07:43.008 --> 07:46.199
and help Miss Meng solve crimes
in the capital.

07:47.560 --> 07:49.920
His Majesty put you in an important position.

07:49.920 --> 07:52.959
But this appointment is rather sudden.
I wasn't told either before.

07:53.879 --> 07:58.120
The Censorate handles corruption cases,
involving dangerous conflicts.

07:58.120 --> 08:01.399
I'm averse to bloodshed
and prefer a quiet environment.

08:01.399 --> 08:03.360
I'm clearly more suited
to work at the Hanlin Academy.

08:04.600 --> 08:08.920
Listen, His Majesty must have his reasons
for his decision.

08:08.920 --> 08:12.839
Solving crimes needs your brain,
not brute strength.

08:12.839 --> 08:14.360
You've been clever since childhood.

08:14.360 --> 08:18.000
What others can't accomplish
is a piece of cake for you.

08:18.000 --> 08:19.720
You make it sound easy.

08:21.360 --> 08:22.920
The Censorate has just been established.

08:23.680 --> 08:26.120
Not to mention those difficult ruffians,

08:26.959 --> 08:29.319
those hypocritical court officials

08:29.319 --> 08:31.360
must have created many barriers in secret.

08:31.360 --> 08:35.759
And even you can't read His Majesty's mind.
How can I not be worried?

08:35.759 --> 08:39.360
Zhi Shu, Zhi Li's concerns are reasonable.

08:39.360 --> 08:43.440
The Hanlin Academy is peaceful
and most suited to her.

08:43.440 --> 08:46.360
But this transfer from His Majesty
came suddenly.

08:47.120 --> 08:50.159
How about we persuade His Majesty
to change his mind tomorrow?

08:50.799 --> 08:52.080
Nian understands me best.

08:54.039 --> 08:57.360
I don't know
why His Majesty made this decision,

08:57.360 --> 09:01.039
but I believe
he must have thought a lot about this.

09:01.039 --> 09:04.159
After all, he won't harm Zhi Li.

09:04.159 --> 09:06.240
Zhi Shu, I think

09:06.240 --> 09:08.039
- His Majesty--
- Nian.

09:08.039 --> 09:11.360
Listen, His Majesty treats us
like his own siblings.

09:11.360 --> 09:13.440
He relies on us and trusts us the most.

09:13.440 --> 09:15.399
Now is the time to employ capable people.

09:15.399 --> 09:20.759
Apart from Zhi Li,
who else is qualified for this position?

09:20.759 --> 09:24.440
Since His Majesty has arranged it so,
I shall take it.

09:26.048 --> 09:27.159
There you go.

09:27.159 --> 09:30.360
You and Miss Meng will surely
make those corrupt officials tremble in fear.

09:35.639 --> 09:39.639
Well, am I some kind of fearsome beast?

09:39.639 --> 09:41.679
You're even sitting so far from me.

09:44.919 --> 09:49.000
Back when we studied together,
Your Majesty was just more perceptive.

09:49.000 --> 09:51.039
And now, Your Majesty controls Gu Qin
and targets Xu Ting as well.

09:51.039 --> 09:53.279
You're quite moody.

09:53.279 --> 09:54.919
If we speak or act improperly...

09:57.759 --> 09:59.840
The four of us grew up together.

09:59.840 --> 10:01.360
You always lose your manners in front of me.

10:02.519 --> 10:06.879
So, are you going
to make a startling speech again? Go ahead.

10:06.879 --> 10:08.679
But you mustn't get angry, Your Majesty.

10:08.679 --> 10:12.120
At least, don't be mad while bathing.
Just pretend you were still the Crown Prince.

10:13.399 --> 10:14.432
Fine.

10:19.480 --> 10:20.759
How dare you!

10:20.759 --> 10:23.000
Shen Zhi Shu!

10:23.000 --> 10:24.120
I was just testing the waters.

10:24.120 --> 10:25.759
Your Majesty promised me not to get angry.

10:26.720 --> 10:27.776
I'm not angry.

10:28.480 --> 10:35.200
I just suddenly recalled how I dealt with you
when I was the Crown Prince.

10:35.200 --> 10:38.360
Your Majesty, please!

10:38.360 --> 10:40.200
Nian, help!

10:44.120 --> 10:46.080
I haven't relaxed like this for a long time.

10:48.039 --> 10:53.279
At 16, I toured the whole nation
on behalf of the late emperor.

10:54.200 --> 10:56.679
But now, I have to pick a fine time
for leaving the palace.

10:56.679 --> 11:01.120
Your Majesty pretended to be drunk
and made Xu Ting so angry that he fell ill.

11:01.120 --> 11:02.519
Why are you still troubled?

11:03.240 --> 11:04.320
He's not really sick.

11:05.120 --> 11:07.720
Half the court officials
submit their memorials to him.

11:07.720 --> 11:09.759
He's clearly acting as a regent at his house.

11:09.759 --> 11:11.600
I embarrassed him,

11:11.600 --> 11:13.519
so he wants to fight back.

11:13.519 --> 11:15.480
The memorials I got

11:15.480 --> 11:18.600
are either about the strict evaluations
of female officials' performance,

11:18.600 --> 11:20.960
or urging me to marry an empress
to stabilize the state.

11:20.960 --> 11:24.080
Xu Ting is clearly putting on airs
as a senior official,

11:24.080 --> 11:25.759
waiting for Your Majesty
to personally invite him back.

11:25.759 --> 11:29.440
The Censorate has just been established,
so I'm happy not to see him now

11:29.440 --> 11:30.799
in case he causes trouble.

11:31.840 --> 11:36.360
Yesterday, Lord Gu used art appreciation
as a pretext to invite Miss Meng and Zhi Li.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.919
This seems like an attempt to win them over.

11:38.840 --> 11:43.600
I heard from Zhi Li
that he is attentive to the Censorate

11:43.600 --> 11:45.360
and said he would spare no effort to assist.

11:45.360 --> 11:48.840
He clearly started a confrontation
with Lord Xu.

11:48.840 --> 11:52.159
Miss Meng is probably in for a rough time.

11:52.159 --> 11:55.919
If she can't even handle this,
how can she manage the Censorate?

11:56.600 --> 11:59.960
I don't know about her,
but Zhi Li definitely can't handle it.

11:59.960 --> 12:01.519
But speaking of which,

12:01.519 --> 12:04.480
I understand why Lord Xu urged you to marry.

12:04.480 --> 12:07.480
Leaving aside your handsome face,
you have a bad temper.

12:07.480 --> 12:10.120
Your mantra: "Insolent",
"How dare you", and "Leave!"

12:10.120 --> 12:11.440
What girl will dare approach you?

12:12.360 --> 12:13.519
How dare you.

12:19.679 --> 12:21.000
See, I wasn't wrong.

12:22.159 --> 12:23.919
Zhi Li and Your Majesty grew up together.

12:23.919 --> 12:26.440
When she was little, she was close to you.

12:26.440 --> 12:29.639
Now, her gaze towards her teacher
is much gentler than towards Your Majesty.

12:29.639 --> 12:31.080
Nonsense!

12:31.080 --> 12:33.759
Zhi Li only respects Lord Gu.

12:33.759 --> 12:36.399
Lord Gu is nearly 50 and has a family.

12:36.399 --> 12:38.799
He always puts on airs.
How could Zhi Li possibly--

12:38.799 --> 12:42.480
Come on, you know nothing but wrestling
with the Divine Guard, don't you?

12:42.480 --> 12:43.919
You don't understand a girl at all.

12:48.159 --> 12:50.279
Your Majesty, don't always keep a stern face.

12:50.279 --> 12:52.080
Otherwise, no girls will dare approach you.

12:54.519 --> 12:58.600
Don't I smile most of the time?

12:58.600 --> 13:01.679
Sure, but with malice.
It's scarier than when you don't smile.

13:04.519 --> 13:09.519
Then tell me,
who else dares to be disrespectful to you?

13:11.080 --> 13:12.256
Who?

13:15.279 --> 13:16.360
None of your business!

13:16.360 --> 13:17.919
Come on, let's drink.

13:17.919 --> 13:19.480
Cheers!

13:24.840 --> 13:27.360
Your Majesty, I was right, wasn't I?

13:29.759 --> 13:33.679
Two hours have already passed.
Are you sure you want to continue?

13:49.824 --> 13:53.312
[Censorate]

13:58.679 --> 13:59.744
Miss Meng.

14:02.707 --> 14:04.608
[Censorate]

14:14.560 --> 14:15.600
Let me help.

14:15.600 --> 14:16.608
Thank you.

14:21.840 --> 14:26.039
Miss Shen, did you move your study here?

14:26.039 --> 14:28.200
I just brought some items I'm used to.

14:28.200 --> 14:31.039
I originally thought of bringing two maids
for cleaning,

14:31.039 --> 14:34.519
but I feared Zhi Shu and Nian would mock me
for turning the office into a boudoir.

14:35.360 --> 14:36.720
I almost forgot the most important thing.

14:42.000 --> 14:45.799
I planted this myself. It's a gift for you.

14:45.799 --> 14:48.240
You can place it on your desk,
and it's best for calming the mind.

14:51.919 --> 14:53.960
Indeed, it smells good.

14:56.360 --> 15:00.039
<i>On our first day,
let's turn this cheerless Censorate</i>

15:00.039 --> 15:02.440
[Censorate]
<i>into the best local office, shall we?</i>

15:02.440 --> 15:03.456
<i>Sure.</i>

15:06.976 --> 15:10.208
[Censorate]

15:25.440 --> 15:29.320
I can't believe this!
The Censorate answers only to His Majesty.

15:29.320 --> 15:32.320
Yet today, on our first day,
the building hasn't even been repaired.

15:33.879 --> 15:36.559
The Censorate is separate
from the two chancellors and six ministries.

15:36.559 --> 15:38.720
I'm an eyesore to Lord Xu.

15:39.639 --> 15:43.120
The Minister of Revenue, Wen Tao, is his man,
so he won't approve the funds.

15:45.120 --> 15:46.919
It's also a perfect opportunity
to show me who's the boss.

15:49.720 --> 15:53.159
But it's just about repairing a building.
I'm most familiar with that.

15:55.080 --> 15:58.759
Go find a cool place to rest.
Leave this to me.

16:03.399 --> 16:06.200
Miss Meng, today is your first day in office.

16:06.200 --> 16:07.840
How can you do the work yourself?

16:07.840 --> 16:10.240
How about I go back
and get some servants to help?

16:10.240 --> 16:11.960
It's fine. No need to trouble yourself.

16:20.679 --> 16:21.679
Who's up there?

16:24.120 --> 16:27.639
Miss Meng, we've met before.

16:27.639 --> 16:28.720
You are?

16:28.720 --> 16:31.039
I'm Yin Qing, a pharmacist from the palace.

16:31.039 --> 16:32.759
What are you doing here?

16:32.759 --> 16:34.600
No one here buys rouge and powder.

16:35.600 --> 16:36.640
Hold on.

16:40.120 --> 16:43.000
In the palace, I was forced by circumstances.

16:43.000 --> 16:47.320
But since you handed me over to Captain Di,
I've come to my senses.

16:49.720 --> 16:51.000
I've now turned over a new leaf.

16:52.559 --> 16:55.559
If you need spices, I'll give them for free.

17:02.759 --> 17:05.079
What is this for?

17:05.079 --> 17:06.279
To ward off evil spirits.

17:06.279 --> 17:11.799
Peach wood dispels evil spirits,
and bronze mirrors reflect evil energy.

17:12.519 --> 17:16.359
After all, it's a haunted house.
They help you sleep soundly at night.

17:16.359 --> 17:17.400
Haunted house?

17:23.359 --> 17:26.000
Miss Meng, Miss Shen, here is the thing.

17:27.680 --> 17:32.519
This place was the interrogation wing
of the Ministry of Justice's prison.

17:35.759 --> 17:41.039
I heard that anyone who was interrogated here

17:41.039 --> 17:42.680
committed suicide out of fear of punishment.

17:44.440 --> 17:48.160
Later, because it was too eerie,
it was abandoned.

17:48.160 --> 17:51.920
This is utterly outrageous!
How could they let us work here?

17:52.759 --> 17:55.359
Miss Meng, yesterday, Lord Gu said

17:55.359 --> 17:57.920
that if anyone deliberately makes trouble,
he would definitely not stand idly by.

17:57.920 --> 17:59.000
Let's go to him now.

18:00.000 --> 18:01.120
Wait.

18:13.720 --> 18:16.680
Miss Shen, don't be afraid.
I've long prepared for this.

18:17.319 --> 18:22.720
Once I finish this ritual,
whatever evil spirits will be gone.

18:24.559 --> 18:25.696
She faints at the sight of blood.

18:37.799 --> 18:38.839
Miss Meng.

18:38.839 --> 18:41.480
- Zhi Li.
- This is the balm I developed.

18:41.480 --> 18:43.480
It can help restore the spirit
and refresh the mind.

18:43.480 --> 18:47.119
Wait, does this medicine really work?

18:48.200 --> 18:53.079
Miss, you can doubt my character,
but you can't question my medical skill.

19:07.400 --> 19:08.416
She's awake.

19:15.440 --> 19:16.480
Your mouth.

19:20.279 --> 19:21.280
Zhi Li.

19:21.880 --> 19:22.944
- Zhi Li.
- One more time.

19:35.119 --> 19:38.720
What's that smell? It stinks!

19:38.720 --> 19:40.279
It helps refresh your mind.

19:42.160 --> 19:45.640
Miss, Miss Shen has just come
and already encountered troubles.

19:46.359 --> 19:48.680
It shows the negative energy here is strong.

19:49.759 --> 19:54.200
Well, why don't you wear my bracelet
to ward off evil?

19:54.200 --> 19:55.680
I don't need it. I'm a tough girl.

19:55.680 --> 19:58.920
I'll take it. I'll pay any price.

19:59.960 --> 20:01.480
It costs only ten taels.

20:07.440 --> 20:10.640
Of course, five taels is also acceptable.

20:13.440 --> 20:17.240
For Miss Meng's sake,
I'll give it to you for free.

20:17.240 --> 20:18.480
That's very kind of you.

20:21.880 --> 20:26.079
Miss Meng, do you think I'm too weak

20:26.079 --> 20:29.160
to handle the position
and will hold you back?

20:30.000 --> 20:31.799
What are you talking about?

20:31.799 --> 20:33.960
When you made a promise before the Xu's,

20:33.960 --> 20:37.079
I could tell you were not a weak young lady.

20:37.079 --> 20:38.240
To be honest,

20:38.240 --> 20:42.640
I thought you'd decline to come
in case you work in dangerous situations.

20:42.640 --> 20:47.799
But today, you came with your elegance.
I was surprised and delighted.

20:52.480 --> 20:55.720
But I never expected you to come.

20:55.720 --> 20:58.279
What exactly is your purpose?

20:58.960 --> 21:02.759
Miss Meng, I heard
that His Majesty established the Censorate

21:02.759 --> 21:04.920
and allowed you
to personally select your assistants.

21:05.559 --> 21:09.200
I wish to work for you, and for His Majesty.

21:10.759 --> 21:13.759
So, you got the roof fixed?

21:14.400 --> 21:18.759
Yes. In the palace,
I always go wherever I'm needed.

21:18.759 --> 21:20.200
I often do the work of two.

21:20.200 --> 21:23.279
If you two need anything,
just command me as you wish.

21:23.279 --> 21:25.200
Although I'm not good at martial arts,

21:25.200 --> 21:28.720
I'm proficient in things
like feng shui, geomancy,

21:28.720 --> 21:31.240
skin care, detoxification,
mechanical devices,

21:31.240 --> 21:33.160
and numerology.

21:33.160 --> 21:35.160
Are you really just a minor official?

21:35.799 --> 21:39.359
You sound more like a legendary figure
from a storybook.

21:40.480 --> 21:41.759
You flatter me.

21:47.720 --> 21:49.960
Miss Meng, this is my latest creation.

21:51.640 --> 21:52.736
It's not smelly.

21:53.440 --> 21:56.240
Pearl Whitening Powder, enhanced version.

21:56.240 --> 21:58.359
I noticed you've gotten a bit sun-tanned.

21:58.359 --> 22:00.559
I'm not interested in this.

22:00.559 --> 22:01.640
Let me take a look.

22:02.519 --> 22:04.880
What is your real purpose?

22:08.200 --> 22:11.079
Miss, since the case of
the true and false Huiyuan,

22:11.759 --> 22:13.720
and then the restoration
of the Imperial Exam for Women,

22:13.720 --> 22:16.119
I've admired you greatly.

22:16.119 --> 22:19.400
You have courage, talent,

22:19.400 --> 22:20.839
capability, and...

22:23.039 --> 22:25.279
Anyway, you're different from
those pedantic people.

22:25.279 --> 22:27.640
Both you and I came from humble origins.

22:28.279 --> 22:30.839
If I could follow you,
I would surely have a bright future.

22:32.480 --> 22:35.799
Of course, I'm here to pledge my loyalty.

22:35.799 --> 22:37.920
If I didn't have some skills,
how could I have the nerve to come?

22:49.839 --> 22:52.599
Miss, this is a new poison I made.

22:52.599 --> 22:54.640
It's called Myriad Colors.
It's colorless and odorless.

22:54.640 --> 22:57.640
One sip will make a person
lose their fighting ability.

22:57.640 --> 22:58.880
You want to poison me?

23:11.839 --> 23:12.992
I'm parched.

23:18.759 --> 23:21.088
Imperial Guard Huang, are you feeling fine?

23:21.088 --> 23:23.008
Are you feeling fine?

23:24.799 --> 23:25.984
Sure.

23:27.559 --> 23:30.400
Miss Meng, it's your first day.
His Majesty sent me to check on you.

23:30.400 --> 23:34.680
If you encounter any trouble,
just use this to command the Divine Guard.

23:34.680 --> 23:36.319
You can also directly report to His Majesty.

23:38.960 --> 23:42.039
Imperial Guard Huang, your voice...

23:42.039 --> 23:43.200
What about my voice?

23:45.359 --> 23:48.799
Is this my voice? What's wrong with my voice?

23:50.519 --> 23:52.240
Yin Qing, the antidote?

23:53.799 --> 23:55.640
Imperial Guard Huang, take this.

23:55.640 --> 23:59.400
In half an hour,
you'll recover your incredible male voice.

24:03.400 --> 24:05.680
How am I supposed to speak
to His Majesty like this?

24:05.680 --> 24:09.680
It won't last for life, will it?

24:09.680 --> 24:11.040
Can I really get my voice back?

24:11.799 --> 24:15.079
This medicine is just developed.

24:15.079 --> 24:17.240
It probably has some side effects.

24:17.240 --> 24:22.039
Listen, go back and sleep on it today.
You should be better tomorrow.

24:22.680 --> 24:24.079
How dare you poison me!

24:24.079 --> 24:25.200
No, it's not like that.

24:25.200 --> 24:28.759
Miss Meng, I originally wanted
to demonstrate this medicine on myself.

24:28.759 --> 24:30.599
But he came and just drank it. I...

24:30.599 --> 24:31.904
Are you out of your mind?

24:31.904 --> 24:33.599
What normal person would poison themselves?

24:33.599 --> 24:36.240
I now suspect you of poisoning me.
You're coming with me right now.

24:36.240 --> 24:37.960
Help, Miss Meng!

24:37.960 --> 24:39.160
- Miss Meng!
- Imperial Guard Huang.

24:39.160 --> 24:41.480
Yin Qing is another colleague of mine.

24:41.480 --> 24:44.559
This is a misunderstanding.
Please let him go.

24:44.559 --> 24:48.480
Imperial Guard Huang,
I can attest he planned to take the medicine.

24:50.319 --> 24:52.440
You better not be caught by me again!

24:52.440 --> 24:53.480
I'll take my leave now.

24:54.440 --> 24:55.616
Take care.

24:57.480 --> 24:58.559
Take care.

25:00.519 --> 25:02.799
Miss Meng, so I can work here?

25:03.440 --> 25:07.440
You just saved my life.
You're my lucky star, my lifesaver!

25:07.440 --> 25:08.759
From now on,
whatever you say, I'll listen to you.

25:08.759 --> 25:10.680
Miss Meng, are we really keeping him?

25:12.680 --> 25:16.480
The Censorate is small,
but it will never hire useless people.

25:18.559 --> 25:22.599
You, stay for now, on probation.

25:24.240 --> 25:25.839
Not small, and I'm useful.

25:25.839 --> 25:27.799
Probation is good. I'll go work now.

25:38.611 --> 25:40.576
[Censorate]

26:46.839 --> 26:49.079
Miss Meng, what are you looking at?

26:50.799 --> 26:51.840
Nothing.

26:54.119 --> 26:56.799
Where did you find these people?

26:56.799 --> 27:00.359
Their wives and daughters
are all my regular customers.

27:00.359 --> 27:04.640
I promised that if they come to help,
they can buy rouge from me at half price.

27:06.720 --> 27:08.079
You really are a jack-of-all-trades.

27:10.000 --> 27:11.839
You're quite good at business.

27:11.839 --> 27:14.599
If Fu Zhi knows you,
you two will definitely get along.

27:14.599 --> 27:17.160
I don't have plans to get married yet.

27:17.960 --> 27:19.440
You wish.

27:21.119 --> 27:22.759
By the way, let's not talk about me.

27:22.759 --> 27:24.759
The backyard is tidied up,
and the meal is ready.

27:24.759 --> 27:25.760
Let's eat now.

27:29.039 --> 27:30.079
Don't put it there. Move it over a bit.

27:38.559 --> 27:40.200
Miss Meng, Miss Shen.

27:40.200 --> 27:43.400
I personally made some dishes.
Please try them.

27:44.480 --> 27:45.839
You sit down and eat with us too.

27:45.839 --> 27:46.976
Thank you so much.

27:49.880 --> 27:50.912
Go ahead.

28:05.160 --> 28:08.119
Yin Qing, you're good at cooking.

28:19.559 --> 28:22.920
Miss Shen, is the food not to your liking?

28:23.759 --> 28:28.200
No, I'm a tiny bit picky about food.

28:30.480 --> 28:34.079
If you have any issues, please tell me.
I'll definitely do it better.

28:36.119 --> 28:38.559
Actually, not many issues.

28:38.559 --> 28:40.359
For this asparagus lettuce with pork,

28:40.359 --> 28:42.759
the asparagus lettuce should be cut
into smaller pieces to absorb the flavor.

28:42.759 --> 28:44.519
The meat should be sliced
as thin as possible.

28:44.519 --> 28:45.799
And for this soup,

28:45.799 --> 28:47.960
the mushrooms must be picked
early in the morning.

28:47.960 --> 28:50.160
Those picked after noon
will have an earthy smell.

28:50.160 --> 28:51.799
And for this stir-fried vegetable,

28:51.799 --> 28:54.000
the salt should be sprinkled lightly,
and less oil should be added.

28:54.000 --> 28:57.160
Ideally, no soy sauce should be added
to preserve the original flavor.

29:06.839 --> 29:10.440
I'm just saying. Don't take it to heart.

29:10.440 --> 29:12.400
Actually, I'm not very hungry.

29:16.359 --> 29:17.472
That's good then.

29:21.960 --> 29:24.039
Now that we've officially started to work,

29:24.759 --> 29:27.720
we must uproot the Huxiao Gang
and the forces behind it.

29:28.359 --> 29:32.519
We can talk with the Supreme Court
and the Capital Prefectural Office

29:32.519 --> 29:34.079
to retrieve the relevant case files.

29:34.079 --> 29:37.319
But currently, the various ministries
are quite critical of the Censorate.

29:37.319 --> 29:41.279
If we follow this procedure,
it might take almost half a month.

29:41.279 --> 29:44.519
If someone deliberately makes trouble,
we can ask His Majesty for help.

29:45.160 --> 29:47.680
I can also ask my teacher to help negotiate.

29:47.680 --> 29:51.279
But if we have to trouble His Majesty
and Lord Gu for such a small matter,

29:51.279 --> 29:53.839
won't that make people think
the Censorate is a soft touch?

29:57.680 --> 29:59.640
Then Miss, what's your plan?

30:01.599 --> 30:04.680
Gangs do evil
simply to amass ill-gotten wealth.

30:05.720 --> 30:08.559
And it's the safest way to accumulate wealth
under the guise of prosperity.

30:09.799 --> 30:13.039
We might find some clues on Changle Street.

30:13.039 --> 30:16.680
Once Bofeng House opens,
it can be a place to gather intelligence.

30:17.359 --> 30:18.368
Yin Qing.

30:18.976 --> 30:20.079
Yes?

30:20.079 --> 30:22.920
Go get a brass gong.
I'm going to do something big.

30:22.920 --> 30:24.032
Got it.

30:25.620 --> 30:30.839
[Heavy Reward for Clues
Related to the Huxiao Gang]

30:30.839 --> 30:32.000
The Censorate is handling a case!

30:32.799 --> 30:36.240
His Majesty established the Censorate
to solve crimes.

30:37.240 --> 30:41.359
Anyone with information about the Huxiao Gang
can come to the Censorate to report it.

30:43.680 --> 30:46.759
What is the Huxiao Gang?
And what crime did they commit?

30:46.759 --> 30:49.920
The court actually
made such a big deal about this.

30:49.920 --> 30:51.680
Since the court sent a female official
to investigate the case,

30:51.680 --> 30:53.120
it's probably not a major case.

30:53.120 --> 30:54.200
Get out of here.

30:54.200 --> 30:55.232
Leave, everyone.

30:55.232 --> 30:56.839
- You...
- Let's go.

30:56.839 --> 30:58.359
There's nothing special to see. Let's go.

30:58.359 --> 30:59.392
- Let's go.
- It's boring.

31:00.916 --> 31:02.656
[Heavy Reward for Clues
Related to the Huxiao Gang]

31:03.680 --> 31:08.079
Miss, this method doesn't seem to be working.

31:12.079 --> 31:14.039
It seems
the Huxiao Gang committed crimes in secret,

31:15.359 --> 31:18.359
while the Heihu Crew did evil openly.
The whole Shazhou knew it.

31:19.279 --> 31:20.720
But as far as I know,

31:20.720 --> 31:22.799
there are quite a few citizens
who come to the Capital Prefectural Office

31:22.799 --> 31:26.200
and the Supreme Court
to complain about ruffians and injustices.

31:29.640 --> 31:33.039
The Censorate is meant to protect the people.

31:33.039 --> 31:37.240
Anyone who commits crimes
or bullies the weak can be reported.

31:38.200 --> 31:40.240
I will definitely seek justice for you.

31:50.304 --> 31:52.704
[Heavy Reward for Clues
Related to the Huxiao Gang]

31:54.440 --> 31:56.960
Miss Meng, let me carry it.

32:08.119 --> 32:10.480
I didn't expect
to see such a dilapidated place.

32:11.160 --> 32:15.720
Mostly, the poor, refugees,
and beggars gather north of the city.

32:16.400 --> 32:19.200
Miss Shen, you were born
into a prestigious family east of the city.

32:19.200 --> 32:20.240
Naturally, you've never been here.

32:23.200 --> 32:24.480
Miss Meng.

32:24.480 --> 32:26.688
[In Mourning]

32:34.119 --> 32:37.559
We've already sold everything we could.

32:37.559 --> 32:39.279
I also borrowed 20 taels from my parents.

32:41.000 --> 32:42.480
But we're still short by more than ten taels.

32:43.480 --> 32:44.839
Thank you.

32:48.880 --> 32:52.559
You were severely injured
by those corpse thieves.

32:53.400 --> 32:54.920
You must not get out of bed.

33:00.480 --> 33:03.799
[In Mourning]
Grandmother, I'm so sorry.

33:03.799 --> 33:08.599
They stole Grandfather's body
and demanded a high ransom for its return.

33:08.599 --> 33:12.559
But we simply can't gather enough money
to redeem Grandfather's body.

33:12.559 --> 33:16.759
Now, even though you've passed away,
I dare not bury you.

33:16.759 --> 33:22.079
I'm afraid
those evil thieves will steal your body

33:22.680 --> 33:24.519
and come to extort us again.

33:24.519 --> 33:29.400
Grandmother, we truly have no way out.

33:34.599 --> 33:35.648
Who's outside?

33:37.839 --> 33:38.912
We're from the Censorate.

33:40.200 --> 33:43.000
I saw you on the street just now.

33:43.799 --> 33:45.640
Get out! Right now!

33:45.640 --> 33:47.200
We mean no harm.

33:47.200 --> 33:49.359
Just now on the street, you looked worried.

33:49.359 --> 33:51.839
I'm afraid you're in trouble,
so I came to check on you.

33:52.440 --> 33:55.480
The Censorate is directly under His Majesty
and acts on behalf of His Majesty.

33:55.480 --> 33:57.960
Speaking to Miss Meng is the same
as speaking to His Majesty.

33:59.440 --> 34:01.359
Miss.

34:02.279 --> 34:03.328
Cheng.

34:05.039 --> 34:07.640
Cheng, you can't say.

34:07.640 --> 34:10.079
If you speak,
Grandfather's body won't be redeemed.

34:23.239 --> 34:30.079
We reported our case to the authorities,
but they considered it minor and ignored it.

34:30.079 --> 34:35.000
Instead, we were threatened
and retaliated against by the corpse thieves.

34:35.679 --> 34:39.519
Miss, we're truly helpless.

34:40.320 --> 34:41.376
Corpse thieves?

34:49.480 --> 34:53.280
Look, what do you think of my outfit today?

34:55.840 --> 34:58.239
I always claimed
to be the hottest man on Changle Street.

34:58.239 --> 35:00.119
But seeing Your Majesty's appearance today,

35:00.119 --> 35:02.360
I can only surrender that title.

35:02.360 --> 35:05.840
If the noble ladies saw Your Majesty,
wouldn't they all drool?

35:05.840 --> 35:08.079
Alright, enough flattery.

35:08.079 --> 35:09.199
How do we leave the palace now?

35:10.599 --> 35:11.760
I was recently looking through old archives

35:11.760 --> 35:14.320
and discovered an abandoned passage
that leads directly outside the palace.

35:15.440 --> 35:16.608
Lead the way.

35:21.344 --> 35:24.544
[Huiyin House]

35:31.320 --> 35:33.719
Cousin,
during my tenure as the Envoy of Customs,

35:33.719 --> 35:36.320
I worked so hard and traveled a lot.

35:36.320 --> 35:37.408
I finally found this...

35:47.639 --> 35:49.119
The rules here are quite interesting.

35:49.960 --> 35:52.280
One must submit a name card
half a month in advance for an appointment.

35:52.280 --> 35:54.719
Each guest proposes a theme,
and the musician improvises a piece.

35:55.519 --> 35:59.159
At the end of the music, they offer tea
that hints at the music's meaning.

35:59.159 --> 36:01.199
Situ Xue, the owner of this place,
has become famous in these two years.

36:01.199 --> 36:03.159
She's known as the top dancer in the capital.

36:03.159 --> 36:05.639
Many spend a fortune just to watch her.

36:07.639 --> 36:11.719
Cousin, at the Flower Festival,
you praised the blossom mark on her forehead.

36:12.760 --> 36:14.440
Alright, what about the clues?

36:15.400 --> 36:18.760
Cousin, we've just come. What's the rush?

36:18.760 --> 36:22.440
In this place,
you must first learn to enjoy yourself.

36:22.440 --> 36:23.584
After you.

36:36.360 --> 36:38.199
It is indeed the Xiyan flower.

36:38.199 --> 36:39.280
Mr. Shen.

36:56.159 --> 36:58.519
It's been a few days. And you look prettier.

37:00.119 --> 37:03.079
Mr. Shen, it's been quite a while
since you last visited Huiyin House.

37:03.079 --> 37:06.920
Many noble ladies have been waiting
to meet you.

37:09.199 --> 37:11.039
And who is this gentleman?

37:11.039 --> 37:12.840
This is my distant cousin, He Du.

37:12.840 --> 37:15.320
He's been feeling down lately
and came to me to have fun.

37:16.000 --> 37:18.519
He heard your music can cheer listeners up.

37:18.519 --> 37:19.960
So he came specifically to listen.

37:24.880 --> 37:27.119
My cousin is unapproachable.
I hope you won't mind.

37:27.920 --> 37:32.119
Since he's your friend,
I naturally dare not neglect him.

37:32.760 --> 37:36.079
This quiet room is best
for one person to clear the mind.

37:37.760 --> 37:39.480
Cousin, take your time.

37:43.320 --> 37:44.384
Thank you.

38:53.800 --> 38:58.440
The Huiyin House is quite famous,
and so is your music.

38:58.440 --> 39:01.320
Your reputation is truly well-deserved.

39:03.000 --> 39:04.079
You flatter me, sir.

39:10.079 --> 39:12.559
I noticed you kept glancing at the screen.

39:13.239 --> 39:14.840
You seem quite interested in it.

39:16.239 --> 39:19.400
This quiet room is full of elegant greenery.

39:20.039 --> 39:23.519
Only the purple flowers on this screen
are exceptionally showy.

39:23.519 --> 39:27.800
You've broken the elegance with it.
It's quite ingenious.

39:27.800 --> 39:28.840
Is there a meaning behind it?

39:30.440 --> 39:31.519
Sure, there is.

39:32.440 --> 39:35.680
Some time ago,
a folk music troupe from Beijian

39:35.680 --> 39:38.400
passed through the capital
and stayed at my place.

39:38.400 --> 39:41.440
I saw the unique floral decorations
on the musicians' foreheads.

39:41.440 --> 39:43.000
So I specifically inquired about it.

39:43.000 --> 39:46.159
This flower is called Xiyan.
It blooms at night and withers by morning.

39:46.159 --> 39:49.599
In Beijian,
it symbolizes fleeting beauty and is popular.

39:50.639 --> 39:54.360
This quiet room is elegant, but a bit dull.

39:54.360 --> 39:58.719
I like Xiyan flowers,
so I had someone craft this screen.

39:58.719 --> 40:02.639
If you like it, how about I give it to you?

40:02.639 --> 40:03.920
I appreciate your kind offer,
but I have to decline.

40:05.239 --> 40:07.639
But according to the books I read,

40:07.639 --> 40:10.239
I learned
this kind of flower symbolizes extermination,

40:11.239 --> 40:13.880
revenge, and hatred.

40:15.880 --> 40:19.880
Sir, please be careful with your words.
Huiyin House opens its doors to guests

40:19.880 --> 40:23.000
and values goodwill and harmony above all.

40:23.000 --> 40:25.719
I have no grudge
against those Beijian people.

40:25.719 --> 40:28.079
I don't think they would deceive me.

40:34.719 --> 40:36.199
There's no need to be alarmed.

40:36.960 --> 40:40.079
The meaning of flowers
is a reflection of our innate desire.

40:40.880 --> 40:42.199
It's a matter of personal interpretation.

40:43.559 --> 40:46.000
Sir, please have some tea.

41:05.599 --> 41:06.752
Good tea.
